I'll see

252
00:22:34,720 --> 00:22:41,720
you

253
00:22:45,560 --> 00:22:48,020
next time.

254
00:23:40,320 --> 00:23:43,097
Older brothers less competent than
younger brothers serve no purpose.

255
00:23:43,180 --> 00:23:45,657
I can't understand how you
never loved your brothers.

256
00:23:45,740 --> 00:23:47,077
Please report Itadori's death.

257
00:23:47,160 --> 00:23:48,917
That's when all the distortion started.

258
00:23:49,000 --> 00:23:50,294
Don't look down on me.

259
00:23:50,380 --> 00:23:51,497
Start by saving me.

260
00:23:51,580 --> 00:23:52,639
This is Checkmate.

261
00:23:52,740 --> 00:23:55,072
Sumiki has been drawn into this game too.
